error[E0059]: the field path `origin.x` needs a record update
  --> tests/ui/05-expressions/records/update_path_in_construction.cheby:17:23
   |
17 |   let shape = Shape { origin.x: 1, size: 2 }
   |                       ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: a construction sets every field directly; a path updates a field inside another one and keeps the rest (§5.11.2)
   = help: set `origin` to a whole value, or start the braces with `..base` to update a copy

